  "text": "2️⃣ The bearish EMA trend...\n\n200 EMA on top 🔴\n48 EMA in middle 🟣\n13 EMA on bottom 🟡\n\nReverse the cheat sheet from above, \n\nUnder 200 EMA = Bearish\nUnder 200 + 48 EMA = More Bearish\nUnder 200 + 48 + 13 EMA = Mega Bearish\n\nVisual example of a bearish EMA trend 👇 https://t.co/ZSVMIRAnHl",
